{"title":"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real solutions from the following system of equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/b/49b9bff970423b38f352cd8d5182f54897673efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y+z = 6\\\\x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 12\\\\x^3 + y^3 + z^3 = 24\\end{array}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"162\" height=\"64\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square the first equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8416704f237151ace1a0a0c17a9db3d5798e35.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + y^2 + z^2 + 2(xy + yz + xz) = 36\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"19\" />\nSubtract the second equation from the result to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9a9e4a45a07653c9b29d51d56a152ebc6faa6a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(xy+yz+xz) = 24\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4d1daf49b68bd5ff40021eff6213f10b505a01.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy+yz+xz = 12\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"15\" />\nMultiply the second equation by the first equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/9/6c9a4dfb4c4dbd60f19eb5b7eba3c65972d30719.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 + xy^2 + xz^2 + x^2y + y^3 + yz^2 + x^2z + y^2z + z^3 = 72\\]\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\nSubtract the third equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3eddb39758be62b7ace2e77f3d12d5bc50a8fa3f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xy^2 + xz^2 + x^2y + yz^2 + x^2z + y^2z = 48\\]\" width=\"314\" height=\"18\" />\nCube the first equation to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca1a8d81dfd953d20b00cc7282cd9eefa7c10400.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^3 + y^3 + z^3) + 3(x^2y + x^2z + xy^2 + y^2z + xz^2 + yz^2) + 6xyz = 216\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83c4978fb993dccfd62489abd556d819657019a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[24 + 3(48) + 6xyz = 216\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d33047b239f348c9a5d2a51931d5b2135def140e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[168 + 6xyz = 216\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/3/a03c646b0b3845c290bd63f151a8580dcada1978.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6xyz = 48\\]\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f7d6eaab85dca74ec09823d71f9d01485cc623.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xyz = 8\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03c8422f13768f13c5b2e72a7d942bf64ac7dd04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/7512155d415658ca6e8684b58e6d2a5648a25366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy+yz+xz = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"144\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a80ea807665e0f051e656f0c44182392b2655f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, the solution triplet is the roots of the polynomial\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2e83c63f425781a1e4cb7ffbd94518551b61094.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3 - 6a^2 + 12a - 8 = 0\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"17\" />\nFactor the polynomial to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb436cac3d75da27c38d3a208f12c1e38302859c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-2)^3 = 0\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is a triple root to the polynomial, the only solution to the system of equations is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b26c1b1e2b18c3e02226ce76a2cc79c9c97366d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(2,2,2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"29\" />, and plugging the values back in satisfies the system.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use Newton's Sums (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Newton%27s_Sums\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Newton%27s_Sums</a>) to solve this problem -- we can say the three variables are roots to a cubic monic polynomial (so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/542dd5262d9938972b493a033305000cae508767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = a_3 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />). From the problem we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/2/742fac60ceba599c9ddc14364a8eca56834d816d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1 = 6, S_2 = 12, S_3 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"18\" /> and using Newton's Sums we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edc4ce98f40f5a279f8c114313d795682374876f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6 + a_2 = 0\\\\ 12 + 6a_2 + 2a_1 = 0\\\\ 24 + 12a_2 + 6a_1 + 3a_0 = 0\\]\" width=\"434\" height=\"15\" />We can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5eaed656cd3499b942d43a6ee96d8baa688394d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> respectively to get the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e09f78f8abeabc880450d77e44141350fd1ce53.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 - 6x^2 + 12x - 8 = 0\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"17\" /> Using the Rational Root Theorem (or trial and error) we can easily find one of the roots -- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and see that the other two roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as well (eg by factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e0c9fe53284fc1fc418baf62e3a7253237ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />) yielding the only solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c2f4983d84c6b724c78295cbf25d7a0345008f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(2, 2, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO\">2002 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017201047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 182/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 992/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5139/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.281      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    7.281      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16519:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017201047 and revision id 175909. Rendering was triggered be